---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>로지스 다이너 · Rosie's Diner — 수제버거 & 밀크셰이크</title>
  <meta name="description" content="1950년대 미국 로드사이드 다이너 감성, 서울 이태원. 수제버거와 진짜 밀크셰이크. OPEN 24H." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pacifico&family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --mint: #1ec8c8;
      --mint-dark: #149a9a;
      --cherry: #e01a2b;
      --cherry-dark: #b30f1d;
      --cream: #fff8e7;
      --cream-deep: #ffeecb;
      --ink: #20303a;
      --chrome-1: #f4f7f9;
      --chrome-2: #c3d0d6;
      --chrome-3: #8fa3ab;
      --gold: #f5c542;
      --shadow: rgba(20, 48, 58, 0.22);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--ink);
      overflow-x: hidden;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .script { font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-weight: 400; }

    .wrap { width: min(1120px, 92vw); margin-inline: auto; }

    /* ===== Checkerboard helpers ===== */
    .checker {
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(45deg, var(--ink) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--ink) 75%),
        linear-gradient(45deg, var(--ink) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--ink) 75%);
      background-size: 56px 56px;
      background-position: 0 0, 28px 28px;
    }

    .stripe-band {
      height: 18px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        -45deg,
        var(--cherry) 0 22px,
        var(--cream) 22px 44px
      );
      box-shadow: inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4), inset 0 -2px 0 var(--shadow);
    }

    /* ===== Neon HERO ===== */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 120px 20px 80px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 18%, rgba(30,200,200,0.22), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%, rgba(224,26,43,0.18), transparent 60%),
        #0d1b22;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 75%),
        linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 75%);
      background-size: 64px 64px;
      background-position: 0 0, 32px 32px;
      opacity: 0.5;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .stars { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
    .star {
      position: absolute;
      color: var(--gold);
      opacity: 0.85;
      animation: twinkle 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .star:nth-child(1){ top:14%; left:12%; font-size:22px; animation-delay:0s;}
    .star:nth-child(2){ top:24%; left:84%; font-size:16px; animation-delay:0.6s;}
    .star:nth-child(3){ top:62%; left:8%;  font-size:18px; animation-delay:1.1s;}
    .star:nth-child(4){ top:72%; left:90%; font-size:24px; animation-delay:1.7s;}
    .star:nth-child(5){ top:40%; left:50%; font-size:13px; animation-delay:2.2s;}
    .star:nth-child(6){ top:18%; left:62%; font-size:15px; animation-delay:0.9s;}
    @keyframes twinkle { 0%,100%{opacity:0.2; transform:scale(0.8);} 50%{opacity:1; transform:scale(1.15);} }

    .open-badge {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--cherry);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 2px solid #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--cherry-dark), 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      transform: rotate(-3deg);
    }
    .open-badge .dot {
      width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #6dff6d; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #6dff6d;
      animation: blink 1.4s steps(2) infinite;
    }
    @keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1;} 50%{opacity:0.25;} }

    .neon-title {
      position: relative; z-index: 2;
      font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
      font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 12vw, 8rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow:
        0 0 6px #fff,
        0 0 14px var(--mint),
        0 0 30px var(--mint),
        0 0 56px var(--mint-dark),
        0 0 90px var(--mint-dark);
      animation: flicker 5s infinite;
    }
    .neon-title .sub-cherry {
      display: block;
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      color: #fff;
      margin-top: 6px;
      text-shadow:
        0 0 6px #fff,
        0 0 14px var(--cherry),
        0 0 30px var(--cherry),
        0 0 60px var(--cherry-dark);
    }
    @keyframes flicker {
      0%,19%,21%,23%,80%,100% { opacity: 1; }
      20%,22% { opacity: 0.78; }
    }

    .hero-tag {
      position: relative; z-index: 2;
      color: var(--cream);
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.6vw, 1.35rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 26px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .hero-tag b { color: var(--gold); }

    .hero-cta {
      position: relative; z-index: 2;
      display: inline-flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }
    .btn {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      font-size: 15px;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 3px solid transparent;
      transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-cherry {
      background: var(--cherry); color: #fff;
      border-color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--cherry-dark), 0 14px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    .btn-mint {
      background: var(--mint); color: var(--ink);
      border-color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--mint-dark), 0 14px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .btn:active { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--cherry-dark); }

    .chrome-divider {
      position: relative; z-index: 2;
      margin-top: 56px;
      width: min(420px, 80vw); height: 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--chrome-1), var(--chrome-3) 55%, #5d6f76);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    }

    /* ===== Section base ===== */
    section { position: relative; }
    .section-pad { padding: 80px 0; }

    .sec-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .sec-title .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
      color: var(--cherry);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
      display: block;
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
    }
    .sec-title h2 {
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .sec-sub {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 46px;
      color: #51636d;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ===== MENU board ===== */
    .menu-sec { background: var(--cream-deep); }
    .menu-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
    }
    .menu-card {
      background: var(--cream);
      border: 3px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 26px 26px 30px;
      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--mint), 8px 8px 0 2px var(--ink);
      position: relative;
    }
    .menu-card .card-head {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 3px dashed var(--cherry);
      padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .menu-card .card-head .ico {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; flex: none;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      background: var(--cherry); color: #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      font-size: 22px;
    }
    .menu-card .card-head h3 {
      font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 1.15rem;
    }
    .menu-item {
      display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px;
      padding: 9px 0;
    }
    .menu-item .name { font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
    .menu-item .desc { font-size: 12.5px; color: #6a7a83; font-weight: 500; }
    .menu-item .leader {
      flex: 1;
      border-bottom: 2px dotted var(--chrome-3);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      min-width: 18px;
    }
    .menu-item .price {
      font-weight: 800; color: var(--cherry-dark);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .tag-hot {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800;
      padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 6px;
      margin-left: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    /* ===== SIGNATURE ===== */
    .sig-sec { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); }
    .sig-sec .sec-title h2 { color: #fff; }
    .sig-sec .sec-sub { color: #b9c8cf; }
    .sig-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 26px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .sig-card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2b3e49, #1b2b33);
      border: 2px solid var(--mint);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px 22px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      transition: transform .2s ease;
    }
    .sig-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-1deg); }
    .sig-emoji {
      font-size: 56px; line-height: 1;
      display: block; margin-bottom: 14px;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));
    }
    .sig-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
      color: var(--mint);
      font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .sig-card p { font-size: 13.5px; color: #cdd9df; font-weight: 500; }
    .sig-price {
      display: inline-block; margin-top: 14px;
      background: var(--cherry); color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px;
      padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 999px;
      border: 2px solid #fff;
    }
    .ribbon {
      position: absolute; top: -12px; right: -10px;
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800;
      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 6px;
      transform: rotate(8deg);
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    /* ===== Speech bubble ===== */
    .bubble-row {
      display: flex; justify-content: center;
      margin: 54px auto 0;
    }
    .bubble {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--mint);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
      padding: 20px 32px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      border: 3px solid #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      max-width: 540px; text-align: center;
    }
    .bubble::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; bottom: -22px; left: 60px;
      border: 14px solid transparent;
      border-top-color: var(--mint);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 0 #fff);
    }

    /* ===== STORE / DINER ===== */
    .store-sec { background: var(--cream); }
    .store-sec::before {
      content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; top:auto; height:0;
    }
    .store-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .diner-visual {
      position: relative;
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 4px solid var(--ink);
      box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--cherry);
      min-height: 360px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, #cfeff0 0 46%, #1ec8c8 46% 54%, #e8f7f7 54% 100%);
    }
    .diner-visual .checker-floor {
      position: absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:0; height: 46%;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(45deg, var(--ink) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--ink) 75%),
        linear-gradient(45deg, var(--ink) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, var(--ink) 75%);
      background-size: 44px 44px;
      background-position: 0 0, 22px 22px;
      background-color: var(--cream);
      transform: perspective(300px) rotateX(42deg);
      transform-origin: bottom;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .diner-visual .booth {
      position: absolute; top: 10%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 60%; height: 30%;
      background: var(--cherry);
      border: 4px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 14px 14px 6px 6px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 -10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    .diner-visual .booth::before,
    .diner-visual .booth::after {
      content:""; position:absolute; bottom:-26px; width: 20px; height: 26px;
      background: var(--chrome-3); border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-top:none;
      border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;
    }
    .diner-visual .booth::before { left: 18%; }
    .diner-visual .booth::after { right: 18%; }
    .diner-visual .sign {
      position: absolute; top: 8%; right: 8%;
      font-family:'Pacifico', cursive; color:#fff;
      background: var(--ink); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
      border: 2px solid var(--gold);
      font-size: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--gold);
    }

    .store-info h3 {
      font-family:'Pacifico', cursive;
      color: var(--cherry); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .info-list { list-style: none; margin-top: 18px; }
    .info-list li {
      display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 2px dotted var(--chrome-2);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .info-list li .k {
      flex: none; width: 30px; height: 30px;
      background: var(--mint); border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .info-list li b { display:block; font-weight: 800; }
    .badges-row { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 22px; }
    .pill {
      background: var(--gold); color: var(--ink);
      border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px 14px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
    }
    .pill.alt { background: var(--mint); }
    .pill.alt2 { background: var(--cherry); color:#fff; }

    /* ===== CONTACT ===== */
    .contact-sec {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(30,200,200,0.25), transparent 55%),
        #0d1b22;
      color: var(--cream);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 0 70px;
    }
    .contact-sec .neon-sm {
      font-family:'Pacifico', cursive;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3.6rem);
      color:#fff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px #fff, 0 0 16px var(--cherry), 0 0 36px var(--cherry-dark);
    }
    .contact-sec p.lead { color: var(--cream); margin: 14px auto 30px; max-width: 480px; font-weight: 500; }
    .contact-card {
      display: inline-flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
      background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink);
      border: 4px solid var(--mint);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 28px 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .contact-card .phone {
      font-family:'Pacifico', cursive;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6vw, 2.6rem);
      color: var(--cherry);
    }
    .contact-card .addr { font-weight: 600; }
    .contact-card .hours { color: var(--mint-dark); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    .social-row { display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; margin-top: 30px; }
    .social-row a {
      width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--mint); color: var(--ink);
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none;
      border: 2px solid #fff;
      transition: transform .18s ease;
    }
    .social-row a:hover { transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.06); }

    footer.foot {
      background: var(--ink); color: #9fb1b9;
      text-align: center; padding: 26px 16px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
    }
    footer.foot .script { color: var(--mint); font-size: 18px; }

    /* ===== Responsive ===== */
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .sig-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .store-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .menu-card { box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--mint), 6px 6px 0 2px var(--ink); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .section-pad { padding: 56px 0; }
      .menu-item .desc { display: none; }
      .btn { padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 14px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      * { animation: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- DEMO BAR -->
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 13 · 로지스 다이너 — 1950년대 미국 다이너 메뉴판 스타일</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="stars" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="star">★</span><span class="star">✦</span><span class="star">★</span>
      <span class="star">✦</span><span class="star">★</span><span class="star">✦</span>
    </div>

    <span class="open-badge"><span class="dot"></span>OPEN 24H · 언제나 환영</span>

    <h1 class="neon-title">
      Rosie's
      <span class="sub-cherry">로지스 다이너</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-tag">서울 이태원 · 진짜 <b>수제버거</b>와 손으로 젓는 <b>밀크셰이크</b></p>

    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#menu" class="btn btn-cherry">메뉴 보기 🍔</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-mint">예약 & 오시는 길</a>
    </div>

    <div class="chrome-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </header>

  <div class="stripe-band" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- ===== MENU ===== -->
  <section id="menu" class="menu-sec section-pad">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-title">
        <span class="eyebrow">Today's Menu</span>
        <h2>오늘의 메뉴판</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="sec-sub">매일 아침 반죽하는 번, 100% 소고기 패티, 그리고 옛날 그대로의 손맛.</p>

      <div class="menu-grid">

        <!-- Burgers -->
        <div class="menu-card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <span class="ico">🍔</span>
            <h3>버거 BURGERS</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="menu-item">
            <span class="name">클래식 치즈버거 <span class="tag-hot">인기</span></span>
            <span class="desc">체다·양상추·토마토</span>
            <span class="leader"></span><span class="price">9,800원</span>
          </div>
          <div class="menu-item">
            <span class="name">베이컨 더블 스맥</span>
            <span class="desc">패티2·베이컨·어니언</span>
            <span class="leader"></span><span class="price">13,500원</span>
          </div>
          <div class="menu-item">
